      "tier": "tooltip",
      "text": "Darius' next Attack deals (140/145/150/155/160% Attack Damage) physical damage and Slows by 90% for 1 second. This Ability refunds its Mana cost and reduces its Cooldown by 50% if it kills the target. This Ability triggers spell effects upon dealing damage.",
